From 9a5c0eccde1bc2a588d45e7b21f562cad1a5fe49 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:47:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] desktop: sidebar dot label treats held cards as
 blocked, repaints on owner-route changes

Follow-ups from the PR #2234 review (review 5891855726, card t_01a1d51712c0eb1b):

1. Held counted as waiting. `rowOnlyWaiting` added `kanban_held` (todo behind a human ask)
   to the known-waiting count, so `{kanban_active:2, kanban_held:1, kanban_parked:1}` read
   "Open work, waiting" while `kanbanStripeCounts` painted the same row red (blocked). A held
   card now keeps the `running` label like a blocked one; only parked cards and current
   waiting observations make a row "waiting".
2. Owner-route stores not subscribed. `ROW_EXECUTION_STORES` claimed to list every store
   `rowExecution` reads, but owner resolution (`knownOwnerForSession` tile owner and runtime
   lookups, `ownerSource` via the active profile/route) picks the roster source from stores it
   did not list. A tile naming the owner, or an active-route switch, repainted the dot only on
   the next 15 s tick. The list now adds a narrow tile-owner key (stored id, runtime, owner
   profile/route; layout edits do not notify), `$activeGatewayRoute`, `$gatewayActivationEpoch`
   and the owner-lookup rows (`$cronSessions`, `$messagingSessions`, `$projectTree`,
   `$unlistedSessionOwnerRows`). The doc comment names what stays tick-only: module state with
   no store (per-runtime event owner map, remembered owner hints, registry sockets).
   `DOT_ROW_STORES` drops its now-duplicate `$messagingSessions`.

Tests (vitest on worker-4, deps tree at base eabb3501bae):
- RED on base with only the test files: 3 failed / 89 passed
  (session-dot-state.test.ts "keeps the running label while a held card paints the stripe red";
  session-status-dot.test.tsx "keeps running when a held card sits beside the waiting one" and
  "relabels as soon as a tile names the owner whose roster reports a running card").
- GREEN: session-dot-state + session-status-dot 92/92; sidebar dirs, sidebar stores,
  execution-observation-row, session-tab-accent 69 files / 935 tests pass.
- tsc -p . --noEmit clean; eslint clean on touched files.
- process-subagent-observations.test.ts has 2 failures that reproduce on the unchanged base.
